{"product_id":"evil-star","title":"Evil Star","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe second story in the bestselling fantasy series The Power of Five by Anthony Horowitz.After his experiences at Raven's Gate, fourteen-year-old Matt Freeman thinks his days of battling evil are over. But he is pulled into another horrifying adventure when he discovers a second gate exists. Matt and his friend Richard travel to Peru and, assisted by a secret organization known as the Nexus, follow a series of clues to the gate's whereabouts. But there is a traitor in the Nexus... Richard is kidnapped. Matt manages to escape with the help of Pedro, a local boy. The pair travel to the Nazca desert and Matt realizes the horrifying truth: the Nazca lines are the second gate - it is about to open. But, this time, will he have the strength to prevent it? \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:130 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Anthony Horowitz \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781406338867 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 349\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44898552217753,"sku":"11RD9781406338867","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/852ad83b91d80d520ca821d62b2cb2f8.jpg?v=1752150750","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/evil-star","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}